  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/667/667-23.htm",
  "statuteText": "667:23 Roll. –\n\nUpon application of the chairman of the state committee of any political party, the secretary of state shall deliver to him a duly certified roll of the nominees of his party for the several offices named in RSA 667:21. None but such nominees and state delegates shall take part in such state convention."
}
